Comment:
 The tensorplate-speech-runtime-* binary packages also contain Python
 distributions that are not part of this source tree: they are fetched by
 digest when the packages are built, and each keeps its own license. Every
 such package lists them, with their declared licenses and the license files
 they ship, in /usr/share/doc/<package>/third-party-licenses.json.

